Now Thalia exists in every heart that feels contradictions. When you grieve someone while celebrating their life, when you love someone despite frustration, when joy and sorrow intertwine—that is Thalia's cracked vessel working as intended. She teaches us that emotional purity is impossible, and our contradictions make us whole, not broken.
